<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanqishu" book-id="b-nanqishu-049" chapter-id="c-nanqishu-049-yinrui" source-id="s-nanqishu-049-yinrui-ws2261984">
  <p id="c-nanqishu-049-yinrui:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanqishu-049-yinrui:p001:m0000" ref="ceq_pnr_q0e">殷叡</persName>字<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-yinrui:p001:m0003" ref="ceq_pnr_q0e">文子</persName>，陳郡人。晉太常<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-yinrui:p001:m0013" ref="ali_hbb_4bn">融</persName>七世孫也。宋元嘉末，祖<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-yinrui:p001:m0025" ref="9ac_ddl_9iz">元素</persName>坐染太初事誅。<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-yinrui:p001:m0034" ref="ceq_pnr_q0e">叡</persName>遺腹亦當從戮，外曾祖<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-yinrui:p001:m0045" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn">王僧朗</persName>啓孝武救之，得免。<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-yinrui:p001:m0057" ref="ceq_pnr_q0e">叡</persName>解文義，有口才，司徒<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-yinrui:p001:m0068" ref="jyx_72x_8t2">褚淵</persName>甚重之，謂之曰：「諸殷自荊州以來，無出卿右者。」<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-yinrui:p001:m0094" ref="ceq_pnr_q0e">叡</persName>歛容答曰：「殷族衰悴，誠不如昔，若此旨爲虛，故不足降；此旨爲實，彌不可聞。」<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-yinrui:p001:m0133" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_AA">奐</persName>爲雍州，啓<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-yinrui:p001:m0139" ref="ceq_pnr_q0e">叡</persName>爲府長史。</p>
</text>
